1	//! Read-only durable release interfaces.
2	//!
3	//! Planning deliberately accepts only exact package identities. It never
4	//! accepts an inline intent or searches for an authority file. Execution is
5	//! intentionally not wired until the provider adapter can prove exact remote
6	//! identities; exposing a permissive fallback here would recreate the legacy
7	//! publish/tag bypass this command family replaces.
